<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian FSB Bank Q1 profit shoots up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian FSB Bank Q1 profit shoots up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter result for Nigerian bank FSB International Bank to end-March 1997. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1997	1996</p>
<p>     Turnover	     1,400     786.8</p>
<p>     Profit before tax  506.6     304.4</p>
<p>     Taxation		  73	62.6</p>
<p>     Profit after tax   433.6     241.7</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
